{{Term/Store|Hearty Lizard|Hearty Lizards|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Lizard}}
Hearty Lizards can be found resting on [[Palm Tree]]s in the [[Gerudo Desert]] and on the shores of the [[Necluda Sea]]. They can be [[Cooking|Cooked]] with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make a [[Hearty Elixir]], which will grant [[Extra Hearts]] when consumed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> However, Cooking them with other ingredients will result in [[Dubious Food]]. The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] also accepts Hearty Lizards as an ingredient to make [[Blue Dye]].

